=2 Walkthrough
* Zone into the {z:Hall of the Gods} for a cutscene.

:* Quick Travel options:
:** Use the {z:Ro'Maeve} {p:Survival Guide} and zone directly into nearby {z:Hall of the Gods}.
:** Zoning backwards from {z:Ru'Aun Gardens} will get you the cutscene.
:*** Using the {p:Survival Guide} is faster than the home points for this.
:** Warping to {z:Hall of the Gods} via the {p:Voidwatch} NPC will also trigger the cutscene.
